<main data-main="1"><section><div class="lg_container"><div class="lg_header"><p class="cs_eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1 class="intro_h1">Privacy policy</h1><p class="art_lede">Placeholder text, to be replaced by counsel. Structure and headings only.</p></div><div class="lg_meta"><div class="lg_metaitem"><span class="lg_metalabel">Last updated</span><span class="lg_metavalue">Date to confirm</span></div><div class="lg_metaitem"><span class="lg_metalabel">Entities</span><span class="lg_metavalue" data-rv="legal-entities">Dawning Inc. · Limus Vita SAS · The Aha Company LTDA</span></div><div class="lg_metaitem"><span class="lg_metalabel">Contact</span><a class="lg_metavalue" href="mailto:hello@theaha.co">hello@theaha.co</a></div></div><div class="lg_body"><h2 class="lg_h2">Who we are</h2><p><span data-rv="privacy-who">Dawning Inc. (dba The Aha Company, United States), Limus Vita SAS (dba The Aha Company, France) and The Aha Company LTDA (Brazil) operate theaha.co.</span> Legal entity details, registered addresses and the data controller for EU visitors to be confirmed by counsel.</p><h2 class="lg_h2">What we collect</h2><ul class="lg_list" data-rv="privacy-collect" role="list"><li class="lg_li">What you send us through the contact form or by email: your name, work email, company, role and message.</li><li class="lg_li">What you enter when you book a call through Calendly.</li><li class="lg_li">Technical data our host processes to serve the site, such as IP addresses in server logs.</li><li class="lg_li">Nothing else: the site runs no analytics and no advertising.</li></ul><h2 class="lg_h2">Why we use it</h2><p>To answer your enquiry, hold the call you booked, and keep a record of the conversation if we go on to work together. Legal basis under GDPR to be confirmed (legitimate interest or consent).</p><h2 class="lg_h2">Third parties</h2><p><span data-rv="privacy-third">Calendly (scheduling) and GitHub Pages (hosting). The contact form opens your email client, so messages reach us by email; email provider to confirm.</span> Each processes data under its own terms; links to be added.</p><h2 class="lg_h2">Retention and your rights</h2><p>Retention periods to confirm. You can ask for access, correction or deletion at hello@theaha.co. EU visitors may complain to their supervisory authority; French visitors to the CNIL.</p><h2 class="lg_h2">Cookies</h2><p data-rv="privacy-cookies">The site itself sets no cookies and runs no analytics. Calendly may set its own cookies when you open the scheduler: list them here with purpose and duration, and add a consent banner where required.</p></div></div></section></main>
